+/*
+ * ---- Camera stage 1/2 and audio capture rails (2026-11-17) --------------
+ *
+ * camcc (clock-controller@ad00000) is already enabled in sm7250.dtsi; the CCI
+ * controllers are not.  Each i2c-bus@N child becomes one i2c adapter named
+ * "Qualcomm-CCI", so cci0 contributes two and cci1 one.
+ *
+ * Camera rail parents follow the downstream tree: S5A = VIO, S8C = VDIG,
+ * BOB = VANA, L16A = VAF.  Linux is the only RPMH voter on this boot, so they
+ * are voted and kept on.  The GPIO-gated rails are modelled as always-on until
+ * the EAST/WEST TLMM tiles are mapped; their enable pads are driven by
+ * picasso-pinmux.
